{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 6789816023504081538,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Adding structured data to built-in exceptions",
      "source_hash": 8719303488863694699,
      "context_hash": 16530898886277989957,
      "translation": "내장 예외에 구조화된 데이터 추가",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585748Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Abstract",
      "source_hash": 14205428931693966264,
      "context_hash": 1178596232363118361,
      "translation": "초록",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585751Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Exceptions like ``AttributeError``, ``IndexError``, ``KeyError``, ``LookupError``, ``NameError``, ``TypeError``, and ``ValueError`` do not provide all information required by programmers to debug and better understand what caused them.",
      "source_hash": 16925837127585469276,
      "context_hash": 3656724584394946726,
      "translation": "``AttributeError``, ``IndexError``, ``KeyError``, ``LookupError``, ``NameError``, ``TypeError``, ``ValueError``\\ 와 같은 예외는 프로그래머가 디버깅하고 예외가 발생한 원인을 더 잘 이해하는 데 필요한 모든 정보를 제공하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585751Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Furthermore, in some cases the messages even have slightly different formats, which makes it really difficult for tools to automatically provide additional information to diagnose the problem.",
      "source_hash": 11342699870941043789,
      "context_hash": 6974156624820992581,
      "translation": "또한 경우에 따라 메시지 형식이 서로 약간씩 다르기까지 하므로, 도구가 문제를 진단하기 위한 추가 정보를 자동으로 제공하기가 매우 어렵습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585751Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "To tackle the former and to lay ground for the latter, it is proposed to expand these exceptions so to hold both the offending and affected entities.",
      "source_hash": 1509756895653433724,
      "context_hash": 1720542702901337109,
      "translation": "전자의 문제를 해결하고 후자를 위한 기반을 마련하기 위해, 이러한 예외가 문제를 일으킨 개체와 영향을 받은 개체를 모두 보유하도록 확장할 것을 제안합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585752Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Rationale",
      "source_hash": 18339363210720796208,
      "context_hash": 11411894735675384743,
      "translation": "근거",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585752Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The main issue this PEP aims to solve is the fact that currently error messages are not that expressive and lack some key information to resolve the exceptions.",
      "source_hash": 17823302259200472370,
      "context_hash": 9814152543872786084,
      "translation": "이 PEP가 해결하려는 주요 문제는 현재 오류 메시지가 충분히 표현력이 없고 예외를 해결하는 데 필요한 일부 핵심 정보가 부족하다는 사실입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585752Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Additionally, the information present on the error message is not always in the same format, which makes it very difficult for third-party libraries to provide automated diagnosis of the error.",
      "source_hash": 7214721425947503313,
      "context_hash": 6913299572978957690,
      "translation": "또한 오류 메시지에 포함된 정보가 항상 동일한 형식인 것은 아니므로, 서드파티 라이브러리가 오류를 자동으로 진단하기가 매우 어렵습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585753Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "These automated tools could, for example, detect typos or display or log extra debug information.",
      "source_hash": 3150298326014944142,
      "context_hash": 13015853686642852625,
      "translation": "예를 들어 이러한 자동화 도구는 오타를 감지하거나 추가 디버그 정보를 표시하거나 기록할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585753Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "These could be particularly useful when running tests or in a long running application.",
      "source_hash": 3700961818565011452,
      "context_hash": 16128661862087122387,
      "translation": "이러한 기능은 테스트를 실행할 때나 장시간 실행되는 애플리케이션에서 특히 유용할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585753Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Although it is in theory possible to have such libraries, they need to resort to hacks in order to achieve the goal.",
      "source_hash": 17373597455916305384,
      "context_hash": 17346290797437881380,
      "translation": "이론적으로는 이러한 라이브러리를 만드는 것이 가능하지만, 목표를 달성하려면 해킹에 의존해야 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585754Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "One such example is python-improved-exceptions [1]_, which modifies the byte-code to keep references to the possibly interesting objects and also parses the error messages to extract information like types or names.",
      "source_hash": 13193697889871499786,
      "context_hash": 13300686646055886727,
      "translation": "그러한 예 중 하나는 python-improved-exceptions [1]_\\ 은 바이트코드를 수정하여 관심 대상일 가능성이 있는 객체에 대한 참조를 유지하고, 오류 메시지를 파싱하여 타입이나 이름과 같은 정보를 추출합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585754Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:2",
      "source": "Unfortunately, such approach is extremely fragile and not portable.",
      "source_hash": 6277986796228118322,
      "context_hash": 16820979803058329034,
      "translation": "안타깝게도 이러한 접근 방식은 매우 취약하고 이식성이 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585754Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "A similar proposal [2]_ has been implemented for ``ImportError`` and in the same fashion this idea has received support [3]_.",
      "source_hash": 14519291378566556802,
      "context_hash": 862794785135167236,
      "translation": "유사한 제안 [2]_\\ 은 ``ImportError``\\ 에 구현되었으며, 같은 방식으로 이 아이디어도 지지 [3]_\\ 를 받았습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585754Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Additionally, almost 10 years ago Guido asked in [11]_ to have a clean API to access the affected objects in Exceptions like ``KeyError``, ``AttributeError``, ``NameError``, and ``IndexError``.",
      "source_hash": 13994486734420655396,
      "context_hash": 4967717509094368686,
      "translation": "또한 거의 10년 전 Guido는 [11]_\\ 에서 ``KeyError``, ``AttributeError``, ``NameError``, ``IndexError``\\ 와 같은 예외에서 영향을 받은 객체에 접근할 수 있는 깔끔한 API를 마련할 것을 요청했습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585755Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:2",
      "source": "Similar issues and proposals ideas have been written in the last year.",
      "source_hash": 7671682399352785996,
      "context_hash": 9648762337430011418,
      "translation": "지난 1년 동안에도 유사한 문제와 제안 아이디어가 작성되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585755Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:3",
      "source": "Some other issues have been created, but despite receiving support they finally get abandoned.",
      "source_hash": 10467414524121944170,
      "context_hash": 3408648712878869177,
      "translation": "다른 문제들도 제기되었지만, 지지를 받았음에도 결국 방치되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585755Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:4/seg:4",
      "source": "References to the created issues are listed below:",
      "source_hash": 16855456459552077925,
      "context_hash": 4058305630960384848,
      "translation": "생성된 문제에 대한 참조를 아래에 나열합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585756Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "``AttributeError``: [11]_, [10]_, [5]_, [4]_, [3]_",
      "source_hash": 18164720123483051217,
      "context_hash": 8293655768412222165,
      "translation": "``AttributeError``: [11]_, [10]_, [5]_, [4]_, [3]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585756Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "``IndexError``: [11]_, [6]_, [3]_",
      "source_hash": 13244309532181016835,
      "context_hash": 6217077745683385835,
      "translation": "``IndexError``: [11]_, [6]_, [3]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585756Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "``KeyError``: [11]_, [7]_, [3]_",
      "source_hash": 8796975550580796757,
      "context_hash": 11065989048464771091,
      "translation": "``KeyError``: [11]_, [7]_, [3]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "``LookupError``: [11]_",
      "source_hash": 7552391647353167708,
      "context_hash": 17187952307483603939,
      "translation": "``LookupError``: [11]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "``NameError``: [11]_, [10]_, [3]_",
      "source_hash": 14561283299014579532,
      "context_hash": 2369379368550859336,
      "translation": "``NameError``: [11]_, [10]_, [3]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "``TypeError``: [8]_",
      "source_hash": 10813241510909676001,
      "context_hash": 15371460384805154748,
      "translation": "``TypeError``: [8]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585759Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "``ValueError``: [9]_",
      "source_hash": 7876797127778565617,
      "context_hash": 7133534798087144958,
      "translation": "``ValueError``: [9]_",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585759Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "To move forward with the development and to centralize the information and discussion, this PEP aims to be a meta-issue summarizing all the above discussions and ideas.",
      "source_hash": 6201856139463793099,
      "context_hash": 1157490932785015446,
      "translation": "개발을 진전시키고 정보와 논의를 중앙화하기 위해, 이 PEP는 위의 모든 논의와 아이디어를 요약하는 메타 이슈를 목표로 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585760Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Examples",
      "source_hash": 2926230321239078022,
      "context_hash": 16921884501704726350,
      "translation": "예제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585760Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "IndexError",
      "source_hash": 9927994483136493962,
      "context_hash": 14237713221971906638,
      "translation": "IndexError",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585760Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The error message does not reference the list's length nor the index used.",
      "source_hash": 16400207674406540683,
      "context_hash": 1461157832389485770,
      "translation": "오류 메시지는 리스트의 길이나 사용된 인덱스를 참조하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585760Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "KeyError",
      "source_hash": 17892054521238619650,
      "context_hash": 1189612608039923955,
      "translation": "KeyError",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585761Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "By convention the key is the first element of the error's argument, but there's no other information regarding the affected dictionary (keys types, size, etc.)",
      "source_hash": 17551967715699196283,
      "context_hash": 13253064889948275490,
      "translation": "관례상 키는 오류 인자의 첫 번째 요소이지만, 영향을 받은 딕셔너리에 관한 다른 정보(키의 타입, 크기 등)는 없습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "dictionary": "딕셔너리"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585761Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "AttributeError",
      "source_hash": 13411205576973352196,
      "context_hash": 1514930685127271085,
      "translation": "AttributeError",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:45:04.585762Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The object's type and the offending attribute are part of the error message.",
      "source_hash": 4171321211680578887,
      "context_hash": 16022491162711118686,
      "translation": "객체의 타입과 문제가 된 속성은 오류 메시지의 일부입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227141Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "However, there are some different formats and the information is not always available.",
      "source_hash": 4108356510706400268,
      "context_hash": 6575765028279987249,
      "translation": "그러나 형식이 서로 다른 경우가 있으며, 정보를 항상 이용할 수 있는 것은 아닙니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "Furthermore, although the object type is useful in some cases, given the dynamic nature of Python, it would be much more useful to have a reference to the object itself.",
      "source_hash": 14261400550778759350,
      "context_hash": 14053515659705818863,
      "translation": "또한 객체의 타입이 어떤 경우에는 유용하지만, Python의 동적인 특성을 고려하면 객체 자체에 대한 참조가 있는 편이 훨씬 유용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:3",
      "source": "Additionally the reference to the type is not fully qualified and in some cases the type is just too generic to provide useful information, for example in case of accessing a module's attribute.",
      "source_hash": 12215634542912950042,
      "context_hash": 12542216095903152957,
      "translation": "게다가 타입에 대한 참조는 완전히 수식되어 있지 않으며, 어떤 경우에는 타입이 유용한 정보를 제공하기에는 너무 일반적입니다. 예를 들어 모듈의 속성에 액세스하는 경우가 그렇습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "NameError",
      "source_hash": 2097878583327704967,
      "context_hash": 14296292961679950125,
      "translation": "NameError",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The error message provides typically the name.",
      "source_hash": 4491466386609021451,
      "context_hash": 7313304808582954515,
      "translation": "오류 메시지는 일반적으로 이름을 제공합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227146Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Other Cases",
      "source_hash": 216439676717683114,
      "context_hash": 6447016876236596066,
      "translation": "기타 경우",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Issues are even harder to debug when the target object is the result of another expression, for example:",
      "source_hash": 5973330076695159955,
      "context_hash": 10033616818983730573,
      "translation": "대상 객체가 다른 표현식의 결과인 경우에는 문제를 디버깅하기가 더욱 어렵습니다. 예를 들면 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227147Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "This issue is also related to the fact that opcodes only have line number information and not the offset.",
      "source_hash": 12893136431184418330,
      "context_hash": 10481754432497407953,
      "translation": "이 문제는 opcode에 오프셋 정보가 아니라 줄 번호 정보만 있다는 사실과도 관련이 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "This proposal would help in this case but not as much as having offsets.",
      "source_hash": 15755758586934682501,
      "context_hash": 10566892373509846549,
      "translation": "이 제안은 이 경우에 도움이 되지만, 오프셋이 있는 것만큼 큰 도움이 되지는 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Proposal",
      "source_hash": 17139217736364358932,
      "context_hash": 15630625501586192371,
      "translation": "제안",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227148Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Extend the exceptions ``AttributeError``, ``IndexError``, ``KeyError``, ``LookupError``, ``NameError``, ``TypeError``, and ``ValueError`` with the following:",
      "source_hash": 14034548574389041371,
      "context_hash": 5188899926437228076,
      "translation": "예외 ``AttributeError``, ``IndexError``, ``KeyError``, ``LookupError``, ``NameError``, ``TypeError``, ``ValueError``\\ 를 다음 항목으로 확장합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "``AttributeError``: target :sup:`w`, attribute",
      "source_hash": 16761614087381107281,
      "context_hash": 5793922349350713343,
      "translation": "``AttributeError``: target :sup:`w`, attribute",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227149Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "``IndexError``: target :sup:`w`, key :sup:`w`, index (just an alias to key)",
      "source_hash": 11221435592769551313,
      "context_hash": 4960419774204944320,
      "translation": "``IndexError``: target :sup:`w`, key :sup:`w`, index (key의 별칭일 뿐임)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "``KeyError``: target :sup:`w`, key :sup:`w`",
      "source_hash": 3319411107032102847,
      "context_hash": 10338315925862188387,
      "translation": "``KeyError``: target :sup:`w`, key :sup:`w`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "``LookupError``: target :sup:`w`, key :sup:`w`",
      "source_hash": 14603184979395452015,
      "context_hash": 11441614847081947690,
      "translation": "``LookupError``: target :sup:`w`, key :sup:`w`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227150Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "``NameError``: name, scope?",
      "source_hash": 5283964356547961763,
      "context_hash": 17103061046803582598,
      "translation": "``NameError``: name, scope?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "``TypeError``: unexpected_type",
      "source_hash": 10677449470826762462,
      "context_hash": 14600089996420857248,
      "translation": "``TypeError``: unexpected_type",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227151Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "``ValueError``: unexpected_value :sup:`w`",
      "source_hash": 1582715658254790527,
      "context_hash": 558147061402314716,
      "translation": "``ValueError``: unexpected_value :sup:`w`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227152Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "Attributes with the superscript :sup:`w` may need to be weak references [12]_ to prevent any memory cycles.",
      "source_hash": 17475703616784199789,
      "context_hash": 5131079878293306503,
      "translation": "위첨자 :sup:`w`\\ 가 붙은 속성은 메모리 순환을 방지하기 위해 약한 참조 [12]_\\ 가 되어야 할 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T19:59:49.269434Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:9/seg:1",
      "source": "However, this may add an unnecessary extra complexity as noted by R.",
      "source_hash": 16846171515384036869,
      "context_hash": 14486945458367724920,
      "translation": "그러나 R.이 지적한 것처럼 이는 불필요한 추가 복잡성을 초래할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227153Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:9/seg:2",
      "source": "David Murray [13]_.",
      "source_hash": 2631641187574081421,
      "context_hash": 2995882082972133232,
      "translation": "David Murray [13]_.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227153Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:9/seg:3",
      "source": "This is specially true given that builtin types do not support being weak referenced.",
      "source_hash": 9760718026426716451,
      "context_hash": 15180220466634014686,
      "translation": "내장 타입은 약한 참조를 지원하지 않는다는 점을 고려하면 특히 그렇습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227154Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "TODO(skreft): expand this with examples of corner cases.",
      "source_hash": 1674096568812902635,
      "context_hash": 8298222366055155231,
      "translation": "TODO(skreft): 경계 사례의 예를 추가하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227154Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "To remain backwards compatible these new attributes will be optional and keyword only.",
      "source_hash": 5827479206908500311,
      "context_hash": 12122790134125681036,
      "translation": "하위 호환성을 유지하기 위해 이러한 새 속성은 선택 사항이며 키워드 전용입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227154Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:12/seg:0",
      "source": "It is proposed to add this information, rather than just improve the error, as the former would allow new debugging frameworks and tools and also in the future to switch to a lazy generated message.",
      "source_hash": 12679906896202976843,
      "context_hash": 9440653337838102844,
      "translation": "오류를 단지 개선하는 대신 이 정보를 추가하는 것이 제안됩니다. 전자의 방식이라면 새로운 디버깅 프레임워크와 도구를 사용할 수 있고, 향후 지연 생성 메시지로 전환할 수도 있기 때문입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227155Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:12/seg:1",
      "source": "Generated messages are discussed in [2]_, although they are not implemented at the moment.",
      "source_hash": 4436129658100531466,
      "context_hash": 4286397572897207506,
      "translation": "생성된 메시지는 [2]_\\ 에서 논의되었지만, 현재는 구현되어 있지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227155Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:12/seg:2",
      "source": "They would not only save some resources, but also uniform the messages.",
      "source_hash": 9841233177393095177,
      "context_hash": 2777493574762357619,
      "translation": "생성된 메시지는 리소스를 일부 절약할 뿐만 아니라 메시지를 통일할 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227156Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "The stdlib will be then gradually changed so to start using these new attributes.",
      "source_hash": 8724957559054401158,
      "context_hash": 8860112950051899309,
      "translation": "이후 표준 라이브러리는 이러한 새 속성을 사용하기 시작하도록 점진적으로 변경됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227156Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Potential Uses",
      "source_hash": 2726367887243557,
      "context_hash": 3910689953634697640,
      "translation": "잠재적 용도",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227156Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "An automated tool could for example search for similar keys within the object, allowing to display the following:",
      "source_hash": 18366586381274625070,
      "context_hash": 14805036999684296214,
      "translation": "자동화된 도구는 예를 들어 객체 내부에서 유사한 키를 검색하여 다음과 같이 표시할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227156Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "See [3]_ for the output a TestRunner could display.",
      "source_hash": 503912276817106559,
      "context_hash": 17751633522273594096,
      "translation": "TestRunner가 표시할 수 있는 출력은 [3]_\\ 을 참조하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T18:08:16.227158Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Performance",
      "source_hash": 1168761202931664327,
      "context_hash": 12175594918159512529,
      "translation": "성능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:31:03.964955Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Filling these new attributes would only require two extra parameters with data already available so the impact should be marginal.",
      "source_hash": 3250204887330177952,
      "context_hash": 13606840040337713080,
      "translation": "이 새 속성들을 채우는 데는 이미 사용 가능한 데이터로 단 두 개의 추가 매개변수만 필요하므로 그 영향은 미미할 것입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:31:03.964959Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "However, it may need special care for ``KeyError`` as the following pattern is already widespread.",
      "source_hash": 10089461650290695608,
      "context_hash": 11754817921330934368,
      "translation": "그러나 다음 패턴이 이미 널리 퍼져 있으므로 ``KeyError``\\ 에 대해서는 특별한 주의가 필요할 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:31:03.964959Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Note as well that storing these objects into the error itself would allow the lazy generation of the error message, as discussed in [2]_.",
      "source_hash": 10245686249649007655,
      "context_hash": 7826850126070533921,
      "translation": "또한 이 객체들을 오류 자체에 저장하면 [2]_\\ 에서 논의된 바와 같이 오류 메시지의 지연 생성이 가능해진다는 점에도 유의하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-08-28T17:31:03.964960Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:12/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "References",
